.TH std::text_encoding::name 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::text_encoding::name \- std::text_encoding::name

.SH Synopsis
constexpr const char* name() const noexcept;  (since C++26)

Returns the primary name of *this. Equivalent to return  name_;.

Accessing elements of name_ outside of the range [name(), name() + std::strlen(name()) +
1) is undefined behavior.

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

Primary name name_ that is represented by a null-terminated byte string.

